OHOS: loopback bridge between the sandboxed desktop and the host. An
authenticated HTTP API: /exec runs an allow-listed set of CLI commands,
/profile/<name>/<file> reads and writes the daemon profile files (the log
read-only, with offsets), and /health reports whether the CLI is usable.

